        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1820100/extras/6271803a27097d20d9a274f210b3f826.poster.avif?t=1788817064\" width=600 height=52 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1820100/extras/6271803a27097d20d9a274f210b3f826.webm?t=1788817064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1820100/extras/6271803a27097d20d9a274f210b3f826.mp4?t=1788817064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a surreal world with a drunken alpaca! Solve puzzles, fish out the most unusual items from rivers, fight watermelon thugs, and uncover all the secrets of this world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1820100/extras/38a6fb986b9b30d2fdef0aa55b47c4a6.poster.avif?t=1788817064\" width=628 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1820100/extras/38a6fb986b9b30d2fdef0aa55b47c4a6.webm?t=1788817064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1820100/extras/38a6fb986b9b30d2fdef0aa55b47c4a6.mp4?t=1788817064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drink. Drink everything you find. There's no prohibition in this game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 40 crazy quests. Some may seem very strange; you never know what to expect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find all 30 funny hats.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1820100/extras/ee7738f062c5dc98a9d551f0b94c410f.poster.avif?t=1788817064\" width=616 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1820100/extras/ee7738f062c5dc98a9d551f0b94c410f.webm?t=1788817064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1820100/extras/ee7738f062c5dc98a9d551f0b94c410f.mp4?t=1788817064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw bombs into portals, blow up rocks, and incinerate your enemies!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A carrot man? Drunken butterflies? Or maybe an INFERNAL CHICKEN? Meet all the inhabitants of this world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1820100/extras/0fb96780f21015a0551f44240bf3203b.poster.avif?t=1788817064\" width=616 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1820100/extras/0fb96780f21015a0551f44240bf3203b.webm?t=1788817064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1820100/extras/0fb96780f21015a0551f44240bf3203b.mp4?t=1788817064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish! You can find more than just fish in the rivers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our main heroine is the cutest alpaca!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1820100/extras/266ce530b7a0631384f8c2054e94ff3f.poster.avif?t=1788817064\" width=628 height=250 ><source src=\"https://